div>\n            </h1>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex flex-row\">\n            <h1 class=\"carousel-date drop-shadow-[0_0px_1.2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]\">\n              23–24 Nov 2026\n            </h1>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex flex-row hidden lg:flex-none\">\n            <a data-turbo-frame=\"modal\" href=\"/events/i-see-buildings-fall-like-lightning-2026-11-23-2026-11-24/share\">\n              <div class=\"pl-2 pt-3 pt-0 text-white hover:text-cine-green\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fill-current h-8 w-6 inline-flex\"><path d=\"M5.08 12.16A2.99 2.99 0 0 1 0 10a3 3 0 0 1 5.08-2.16l8.94-4.47a3 3 0 1 1 .9 1.79L5.98 9.63a3.03 3.03 0 0 1 0 .74l8.94 4.47A2.99 2.99 0 0 1 20 17a3 3 0 1 1-5.98-.37l-8.94-4.47z\"></path></svg>\n\n                <div class=\"inline-flex uppercase pt-1 pl-3 text-base font-carbon font-normal\">share</div>\n              </div>\n</a>          </div>\n          <div class=\"hidden lg:flex flex-row py-2\">\n            <p class=\"h3 carousel-meta !text-black !opacity-100 !bg-white/[.90]\">\n              Drama\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"px-0 hidden lg:grid grid-cols-2\">\n              <div>\n                <div id=\"event_like_text_1a127bdc-8202-4c46-a337-32a50a99b51b\">\n</div>\n\n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n  <div class=\"md:px-8 lg:px-0 bg-content-background flex flex-col\">\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 pb-2 lg:pb-6 md:py-4\">\n      <div id=\"meta-column\" class=\"hidden lg:flex flex-col col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 pl-4 lg:pl-8\">\n        <div class=\"pb-5 md:pb-6 lg:hidden\">\n  <h3 class=\"event-about-title\">\n    I See Buildings Fall Like Lightning\n    <img class=\"img-fluid bbfc-rating-small inline-block\" alt=\"bbfc-15\" src=\"https://assets.cinematik.app/assets/bbfc/15-7cf1f075c2e26c90e8886460ef53c401ee69670749e89700b4865cca71ba7401.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" />\n    <a data-turbo-frame=\"modal\" href=\"/events/i-see-buildings-fall-like-lightning-2026-11-23-2026-11-24/share\">\n      <div class=\"flex md:inline-flex pl-2 pt-3 md:pt-0 text-highlight\">\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fill-current h-8 w-6 inline-flex\"><path d=\"M5.08 12.16A2.99 2.99 0 0 1 0 10a3 3 0 0 1 5.08-2.16l8.94-4.47a3 3 0 1 1 .9 1.79L5.98 9.63a3.03 3.03 0 0 1 0 .74l8.94 4.47A2.99 2.99 0 0 1 20 17a3 3 0 1 1-5.98-.37l-8.94-4.47z\"></path></svg>\n\n        <div class=\"inline-flex uppercase pt-1 pl-3 text-base font-carbon font-normal text-project-text\">share</div>\n      </div>\n</a>  </h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-7\">\n    <div class='mb-4 p-2 bg-content-background border border-1 border-cine-green'>\n      This event is part of Escapes, an offering that gives you the chance to get down to your local cinema for free! Supported by the BFI, awarding National Lottery Good Cause funding.\n    </div>\n  <div class=\"trix-content\">\n  <div>Childhood friends Patrick, Shiv, Rian, Oli, and Conor played together, skipped school together, and dreamt of the lives they would have one day. Now they’re thirty, and the future they imagined is slipping quietly out of reach. <br><br><strong>Escapes is proud to partner with Tubi, connecting the UK’s largest free trip to the cinema with the UK’s largest free streaming platform.</strong></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"trix-content\">\n  <div class=\"trix-content\">\n  <div class=\"trix-content\">\n  <div class=\"trix-content\">\n  \n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"flex justify-center bg-white inline-flex w-full mt-4\">\n  <div class=\"col-span-8 w-full pb-8 lg:pb-0 video-responsive\">\n    <div id=\"player\" data-plyr-provider=\"youtube\" data-plyr-embed-id=\"https://youtu.be/J_JlQdYwBF8\" data-controller=\"video\" data-video-target=\"frame\" data-video-video-id-value=\"https://youtu.be/J_JlQdYwBF8\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lg:mt-8\">\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-2 2xl:col-span-1\">\n      <h4 class=\"event-about-heading\">\n        Director\n      </h4>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-6\">\n      <h4 class=\"event-about-details -mt-2 lg:mt-0\">\n        Clio Barnard\n      </h4>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 2xl:col-span-5\"></div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-2 2xl:col-span-1\">\n      <h4 class=\"event-about-heading\">\n        Cast\n      </h4>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-6\">\n      <h4 class=\"event-about-details -mt-2 lg:mt-0\">\n        Anthony Boyle, Lola Petticrew, Joe Cole, Daryl McCormack, Jay Lycurgo, Millie Brady, Lucie Shorthouse, James Eeles, Ryan Walker-Edwards, Sam Brasenell\n      </h4>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 2xl:col-span-5\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 w-full inline-flex pb-0 px-2 md:px-0 lg:pr-8 lg:pl-0\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col bg-content-background w-full\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl uppercase font-normal mb-1 bg-content-background\">Find Venues Near Me</h2>\n              <turbo-frame id=\"screenings-container\">\n  <div class=\"w-full px-2 py-2 bg-form-color text-cine-light-grey mb-1\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 w-full justify-between\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-turbo-frame=\"screenings-container\" data-turbo-action=\"advance\" href=\"/events/i-see-buildings-fall-like-lightning-2026-11-23-2026-11-24/map\">\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fill-current inline-block w-4 h-4 mr-1.5\"><path d=\"M10 20S3 10.87 3 7a7 7 0 1 1 14 0c0 3.87-7 13-7 13zm0-11a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4z\"></path></svg>\n\n        Map&nbs