     </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</a></div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex w-full pb-1 border-b border-white md:border-none\">\n    <a data-turbo=\"false\" class=\"flex flex-row w-full bg-form-color-body text-cine-light-grey transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-form-color spec--open-screening-book-cta\" href=\"/book/i-see-buildings-fall-like-lightning-relaxed-screenings-phoenix-cinema-trust-limited-phoenix-cinema-2026-11-24\">\n        <div class=\"w-full flex flex-col justify-between px-4 sm:px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-4 xl:px-8\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-around info-row my-2\">\n      <div id=\"title-row\" class=\"flex justify-between\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-project-text text-2xl lg:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-slim normal-case font-normal\">\n          Phoenix Cinema, London\n        </h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-row justify-between\">\n        <h2 class=\"sr-only\">\n            Showing on\n        </h2>\n        <h3 class=\"text-project-text text-base font-slim normal-case font-normal flex items-center\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block w-4 h-4 mr-2 fill-current\"><path d=\"M1 4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4zm2 2v12h14V6H3zm2-6h2v2H5V0zm8 0h2v2h-2V0zM5 9h2v2H5V9zm0 4h2v2H5v-2zm4-4h2v2H9V9zm0 4h2v2H9v-2zm4-4h2v2h-2V9zm0 4h2v2h-2v-2z\"></path></svg>\n\n          Tue 24th Nov, 17:00\n        </h3>\n        <div class=\"text-right content-start uppercase\">\n            <div class=\"py-1 px-2 rounded-md bg-button-color text-button-text opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\">\n              Book Now\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</a></div>\n\n</turbo-frame>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"meta-column\" class=\"flex flex-col col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 pt-1 lg:pt-0 px-4 md:px-0 lg:hidden\">\n        <div class=\"pb-5 md:pb-6 lg:hidden\">\n  <h3 class=\"event-about-title\">\n    I See Buildings Fall Like Lightning (Relaxed Screenings)\n    <img class=\"img-fluid bbfc-rating-small inline-block\" alt=\"bbfc-15\" src=\"https://assets.cinematik.app/assets/bbfc/15-7cf1f075c2e26c90e8886460ef53c401ee69670749e89700b4865cca71ba7401.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" />\n    <a data-turbo-frame=\"modal\" href=\"/events/i-see-buildings-fall-like-lightning-relaxed-screenings-2026-11-23-2026-11-24/share\">\n      <div class=\"flex md:inline-flex pl-2 pt-3 md:pt-0 text-highlight\">\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fill-current h-8 w-6 inline-flex\"><path d=\"M5.08 12.16A2.99 2.99 0 0 1 0 10a3 3 0 0 1 5.08-2.16l8.94-4.47a3 3 0 1 1 .9 1.79L5.98 9.63a3.03 3.03 0 0 1 0 .74l8.94 4.47A2.99 2.99 0 0 1 20 17a3 3 0 1 1-5.98-.37l-8.94-4.47z\"></path></svg>\n\n        <div class=\"inline-flex uppercase pt-1 pl-3 text-base font-carbon font-normal text-project-text\">share</div>\n      </div>\n</a>  </h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-7\">\n    <div class='mb-4 p-2 bg-content-background border border-1 border-cine-green'>\n      This event is part of Escapes, an offering that gives you the chance to get down to your local cinema for free! Supported by the BFI, awarding National Lottery Good Cause funding.\n    </div>\n  <div class=\"trix-content\">\n  <div>Childhood friends Patrick, Shiv, Rian, Oli, and Conor played together, skipped school together, and dreamt of the lives they would have one day. Now they’re thirty, and the future they imagined is slipping quietly out of reach. <br><br><strong>Escapes is proud to partner with Tubi, connecting the UK’s largest free trip to the cinema with the UK’s largest free streaming platform.</strong></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"trix-content\">\n  <div class=\"trix-content\">\n  <div class=\"trix-content\">\n  \n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"flex justify-center bg-white inline-flex w-full mt-4\">\n  <div class=\"col-span-8 w-full pb-8 lg:pb-0 video-responsive\">\n    <div id=\"player\" data-plyr-provider=\"youtube\" data-plyr-embed-id=\"https://youtu.be/J_JlQdYwBF8\" data-controller=\"video\" data-video-target=\"frame\" data-video-video-id-value=\"https://youtu.be/J_JlQdYwBF8\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lg:mt-8\">\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-2 2xl:col-span-1\">\n      <h4 class=\"event-about-heading\">\n        Director\n      </h4>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-6\">\n      <h4 class=\"event-about-details -mt-2 lg:mt-0\">\n        Clio Barnard\n      </h4>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 2xl:col-span-5\"></div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-2 2xl:col-span-1\">\n      <h4 class=\"event-about-heading\">\n        Cast\n      </h4>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-6\">\n      <h4 class=\"event-about-details -mt-2 lg:mt-0\">\n        Anthony Boyle, Lola Petticrew, Joe Cole, Daryl McCormack, Jay Lycurgo, Millie Brady, Lucie Shorthouse, James Eeles, Ryan Walker-Edwards, Sam Brasenell\n      </h4>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 2xl:col-span-5\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n      </div>\n        <div class='mx-4 lg:mx-8 mt-4 mb-8 p-2 bg-content-background border border-1 border-cine-green col-span-12'>\n          This film will be shown with descriptive subtitles on screen.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-span-12 text-center text-sm text-gray-500 py-4\">\n          <a class=\"underline text-cine-dark-grey hover:text-gray-700\" href=\"/events/i-see-buildings-fall-like-lightning-relaxed-screenings-2026-11-23-2026-11-24/press\">For press / media kit</a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n          <turbo-frame id=\"modal\" target=\"_top\">\n</turbo-frame>\n        </main>\n      \n    </div>\n    \n    <footer id='footer' class=\"footer-1 py-2 lg:py-12 border-t-2\">\n  <div 