proud to partner with Tubi, connecting the UK’s largest free\">\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"drama, i see buildings fall like lightning, clio barnard, anthony boyle, lola petticrew, joe cole, bbfc 15, cinema, film screening\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://escapes.cinematik.app/book/i-see-buildings-fall-like-lightning-orion-cinemas-limited-orion-cinema-burgess-hill-2026-11-23\">\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Escapes\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"I See Buildings Fall Like Lightning\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Childhood friends Patrick, Shiv, Rian, Oli, and Conor played together, skipped school together, and dreamt of the lives they would have one day. Now they’re thirty, and the future they imagined is slipping quietly out of reach. Escapes is proud to partner with Tubi, connecting the UK’s largest free\">\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"video.movie\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://escapes.cinematik.app/book/i-see-buildings-fall-like-lightning-orion-cinemas-limited-orion-cinema-burgess-hill-2026-11-23\">\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://assets.cinematik.app/rails/active_storage/representations/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6ImY1Mzg1NmZjLTg2ZmQtNDE4Zi04NjFmLWZiNzk5OGJmOTQ4OSIsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--e8439acbac0da155af02204b301a29cc5eba6c8d/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6eyJmb3JtYXQiOiJqcGciLCJyZXNpemVfdG9fZmlsbCI6WzEyMDAsNjMwXX0sInB1ciI6InZhcmlhdGlvbiJ9fQ==--f0c34b02831ed81d0cbf3073d6b4c80163dce0f1/i_see_buildings_fall_like_lightning_backdrop.jpg\">\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\">\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\">\n<meta name=\"image\" content=\"https://assets.cinematik.app/rails/active_storage/representations/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6ImY1Mzg1NmZjLTg2ZmQtNDE4Zi04NjFmLWZiNzk5OGJmOTQ4OSIsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--e8439acbac0da155af02204b301a29cc5eba6c8d/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6eyJmb3JtYXQi